---
import ZetaLayout from "../../../layouts/ZetaLayout.astro";
---
<ZetaLayout
	lang="zh"
	title="Zeta — 终端编码代理"
	description="Zeta 是运行在终端里的编码代理：子代理、计划模式、LSP、DAP、事后记忆、hashline 编辑、时间旅行规则——由原生 Rust 引擎驱动。OMP 兼容发行版。"
	active="home"
>
	<section class="hero">
		<div class="hero-inner">
			<div class="kicker">终端编码代理 · OMP 兼容发行版</div>
			<h1>代理框架千千万，<br>这一个属于<span class="accent">你。</span></h1>
			<p class="lede">
				<strong>Zeta</strong> 是运行在终端里的编码代理：<strong>子代理</strong>、<strong>计划模式</strong>、
				<strong>LSP</strong>、<strong>DAP</strong>、<strong>事后记忆</strong>、<strong>hashline 编辑</strong>、
				<strong>时间旅行规则</strong>——由原生 Rust 引擎驱动。主线同步 <strong>OMP</strong> 上游，
				并移植 <strong>Pi</strong> 的高级能力。
			</p>
			<div class="cta-row">
				<a class="cta primary" href="#install">开始使用</a>
				<a class="cta ghost" href="/zeta/zh/features/">查看特性 →</a>
			</div>
			<div class="install" id="install">
				<div class="tabs">
					<button class="tab active" type="button" data-tab="npm">npm</button>
					<button class="tab" type="button" data-tab="bun">bun</button>
					<button class="tab" type="button" data-tab="linux">Linux</button>
					<button class="tab" type="button" data-tab="windows">Windows</button>
					<span class="tab-ind" id="tabInd" aria-hidden="true"></span>
				</div>
				<div class="code" data-pane="npm">
					<span class="cmd"><span class="prompt">$</span><span class="type" data-typing="npm install -g @linxiraos/zeta">npm install -g @linxiraos/zeta</span></span>
					<button class="copy-btn" type="button" data-copy="npm install -g @linxiraos/zeta" data-done="已复制">复制</button>
				</div>
				<div class="code" data-pane="bun" hidden>
					<span class="cmd"><span class="prompt">$</span><span class="type" data-typing="bun add -g @linxiraos/zeta">bun add -g @linxiraos/zeta</span></span>
					<button class="copy-btn" type="button" data-copy="bun add -g @linxiraos/zeta" data-done="已复制">复制</button>
				</div>
				<div class="code" data-pane="linux" hidden>
					<span class="cmd"><span class="prompt">$</span><span class="type" data-typing="curl -fsSL https://linxira-os.github.io/install.sh | sh">curl -fsSL https://linxira-os.github.io/install.sh | sh</span></span>
					<button class="copy-btn" type="button" data-copy="curl -fsSL https://linxira-os.github.io/install.sh | sh" data-done="已复制">复制</button>
				</div>
				<div class="code" data-pane="windows" hidden>
					<span class="cmd"><span class="prompt">PS&gt;</span><span class="type" data-typing="irm https://linxira-os.github.io/install.ps1 | iex">irm https://linxira-os.github.io/install.ps1 | iex</span></span>
					<button class="copy-btn" type="button" data-copy="irm https://linxira-os.github.io/install.ps1 | iex" data-done="已复制">复制</button>
				</div>
				<p class="install-note">
					国内网络：官方源直连慢时可用腾讯镜像
					<code>npm install -g @linxiraos/zeta --registry=https://mirrors.cloud.tencent.com/npm/</code>；
					阿里 npmmirror 曾因同步延迟缺 <code>pi-natives@1.0.2</code> 导致安装失败，遇到报错请换官方源或腾讯镜像。
					桌面版（图形界面）见 <a href="https://github.com/Linxira-OS/linxira-zeta/releases" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub Releases</a>。
				</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="block" id="goals">
		<div class="section-head">
			<div class="num">01</div>
			<div>
				<h2>设计目标</h2>
				<div class="sub">三个优先级贯穿每个版本：现代化的开箱即用体验、以缓存为先的执行、随你成长的代理。</div>
			</div>
		</div>
		<div class="grid-table">
			<div class="grid-item"><div class="idx">01</div><h3><span class="k">M</span>现代化优先</h3><p>清晰的产品身份、安全的引导流程、可靠的会话、功能完善的 Web UI——普通编码工作无需手动组装扩展。</p></div>
			<div class="grid-item"><div class="idx">02</div><h3><span class="k">C</span>缓存优先</h3><p>不牺牲协议正确性、工具新鲜度与会话可靠性的前提下，保留提供商提示缓存资格。长会话保持低成本。</p></div>
			<div class="grid-item"><div class="idx">03</div><h3><span class="k">E</span>自定义自我进化</h3><p>扩展、技能、提示模板与主题都是一等公民。让代理构建你需要的——它可以现场自定义自己。</p></div>
			<div class="grid-item"><div class="idx">04</div><h3><span class="k">U</span>上游可合并</h3><p>运行时树、包布局、Bun 工作流与内部 <span class="keycap">@zeta/*</span> 包名沿用 OMP 约定，上游更新保持可合并。</p></div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="block" id="highlights">
		<div class="section-head">
			<div class="num">02</div>
			<div>
				<h2>主线 OMP，进阶 Pi</h2>
				<div class="sub">运行时、包布局与工作流沿用 OMP 约定，保持上游可合并；Pi 的上下文工程与扩展原语作为高级内容移植进来。</div>
			</div>
		</div>
		<div class="grid-table">
			<div class="grid-item"><div class="idx">01</div><h3><span class="k">S</span>子代理 Subagents</h3><p>并行子代理携带独立上下文与工具集，主会话汇总结果。</p></div>
			<div class="grid-item"><div class="idx">02</div><h3><span class="k">P</span>计划模式 Plan mode</h3><p>先规划再执行，批准后才触碰工作区。</p></div>
			<div class="grid-item"><div class="idx">03</div><h3><span class="k">L</span>LSP + DAP</h3><p>语言服务与调试适配器内置：跳转、诊断、断点、栈帧。</p></div>
			<div class="grid-item"><div class="idx">04</div><h3><span class="k">H</span>事后记忆</h3><p>回顾过往会话的成败教训，后续任务自动利用。</p></div>
			<div class="grid-item"><div class="idx">05</div><h3><span class="k">E</span>Hashline 编辑</h3><p>内容寻址的行级编辑，重构与批量替换可追溯。</p></div>
			<div class="grid-item"><div class="idx">06</div><h3><span class="k">R</span>原生 Rust 引擎</h3><p>文本、正则、grep 与 diff 重活交给 Rust 原语。</p></div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="block" id="modes">
		<div class="section-head">
			<div class="num">03</div>
			<div>
				<h2>四种运行模式</h2>
				<div class="sub">从全功能 TUI 到脚本、事件流与程序化嵌入。</div>
			</div>
		</div>
		<div class="modes">
			<div class="mode"><div class="mname"><span class="dot"></span>交互式</div><p>完整 TUI 体验：面板、预览、工具卡片与快捷键。</p></div>
			<div class="mode"><div class="mname"><span class="dot"></span>Print / JSON</div><p><code>zeta -p "query"</code> 输出即用；<code>--mode json</code> 输出事件流。</p></div>
			<div class="mode"><div class="mname"><span class="dot alt"></span>RPC</div><p>stdin/stdout 上的 JSON 协议，供非 Node 集成调用。</p></div>
			<div class="mode"><div class="mname"><span class="dot alt"></span>SDK</div><p>以库的形式嵌入你的应用，控制代理生命周期。</p></div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="block" id="providers">
		<div class="section-head">
			<div class="num">04</div>
			<div>
				<h2>15+ 提供商，数百个模型</h2>
				<div class="sub">会话中用 <span class="keycap">/model</span> 或 <span class="keycap">Ctrl+L</span> 随时切换模型。</div>
			</div>
		</div>
		<div class="tag-row">
			<span class="tag hot">Anthropic</span><span class="tag hot">OpenAI</span><span class="tag hot">Google</span>
			<span class="tag">Azure</span><span class="tag">Bedrock</span><span class="tag">Mistral</span>
			<span class="tag">Groq</span><span class="tag">Cerebras</span><span class="tag">xAI</span>
			<span class="tag">Hugging Face</span><span class="tag">Kimi</span><span class="tag">MiniMax</span>
			<span class="tag">NVIDIA</span><span class="tag">OpenRouter</span><span class="tag">Ollama</span>
			<span class="tag">更多…</span>
		</div>
	</section>
</ZetaLayout>
